Nethack is filled with stuff that's tempting to use that ends up
being a waste of effort.  I think the DevTeam put in a lot of
variety to give folks more ways to die.  On earlier levels there
are weapons classes and skills slots with no artifact weapons
as another example.  Play a common strategy using an artifact
weapon as your main melee wield and every #enhance used on
those weapons classes ends up wasted.  Same with twohanded
weapons in the late game.  Same with gems once you can
kill shopkeepers easily, and so on.  Note that each one has
a place at some point in the game then bears an unexpected cost.

"Don't do that in future games" is valid advice even if it doesn't
help at all in the current game.



